# Node.js via nvm

This project is pinned to **Node.js 24** through nvm (see `.nvmrc`).

When running Node, npm, or Next.js commands:

1. Source nvm if it is not already loaded: `. "$HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh"`
2. Select the project version: `nvm use` (install with `nvm install` if needed)
3. Confirm `node -v` starts with `v24.` and `which node` is under `~/.nvm/versions/node/`
4. Do not use Homebrew, system, or Volta Node for this repo

`npm` scripts (`preinstall`, `predev`, `prebuild`) also refuse to run on any Node major other than 24.
